/* ---------------- imported HTML games: the Game tab ----------------
   A game made outside Vira (for example with Claude) lives in Ed.project.htmlGame as its original HTML plus your edits:
   { file, html, edits: { TABLE: { row: { field: value } } }, media: { key: dataURL } }. imp.js finds the data tables and
   writes the edits back into the code for Play and Export, so the game itself never has to change shape to be edited. */
